# Open in VS Code with the REST Client extension and click "Send Request" above each block.
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### Import the sample export (path set by CLAIMS_SAMPLE_FILE)
POST {{baseUrl}}/imports/sample

### Import an uploaded export file
POST {{baseUrl}}/imports
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=EXPORT

--EXPORT
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="legacy_claims_export.txt"
Content-Type: text/plain

< ./data/legacy_claims_export.txt
--EXPORT--

### Get one claim
GET {{baseUrl}}/claims/CLM0000001

### Unknown claim -> 404
GET {{baseUrl}}/claims/CLM9999999

### Claims by status
GET {{baseUrl}}/claims?status=DN

### Unknown status -> 400
GET {{baseUrl}}/claims?status=XX

### All claims
GET {{baseUrl}}/claims

### Health
GET {{baseUrl}}/actuator/health
